1. **BUG-1085 (CEMANAGER) and BUG-1086 (CE_VERSION), pull request #1730:** if you open Manager or About CE Suite and close it, the next U now undoes your last real edit, for example the circle you drew. Before, that U was spent on CEMANAGER or CE_VERSION. 935 Manager tests and 19,526 Civil tests passed, with none failing.
